The quick keep ([[K]]) used to clear the tags whatever the record held.
On a pending paper that is nothing, and on a discard it drops the
motivations, which do not describe a keep; both stay so.  On a record
that is already kept it now leaves the tags as they are.  Clearing
them there made [[K]] say something the human did not mean: on an
unreviewed machine keep it removed the category, so under the rule
above every agreeing [[K]] counted as a change, set [[is_example]] and
opened the reason prompt, and the report read each such paper as
\enquote{changed}.  The human who presses [[K]] on a keep agrees that
it is kept; with the tags left, that is a confirmation, stored exactly
as [[C]] stores it.  A human who wants other themes uses [[T]].

