The race: [[sessions resume --blind]] opens the session in blind mode
with a reviewer's name; while the TUI is open, the reviewer screens the
sampled paper, and another process, a real one, resets the decision
and saves.  The TUI then exits and [[sessions resume]] saves.  Both
records, the snapshot and the reviewer's screening, are set aside with
the reset's time, and the reset stands.  The application's [[run]] is
replaced by a headless run of the same application, since a terminal is
what a test cannot have; everything else, the loading, the keys and the
save, is the command's own.

